**Risk 3:**
**Description:**
The no entry sign might not be clearly visible due to fog, leading to unauthorized entry into the restricted area, increasing the risk of head-on collisions.

**Severity Score:**
0.75

### Summary of Risks in RDF Risk Class

```turtle
ex:Risk1 a ex:SafetyRisk ;
    ex:riskDescription "Reduced visibility due to fog/mist obscures traffic signs, lights, and potential pedestrians/vehicles." ;
    ex:severityScore "0.85"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:riskClass ex:VisibilityRisk .

ex:Risk2 a ex:SafetyRisk ;
    ex:riskDescription "Traffic light signal may not be noticed in time due to low visibility, increasing collision risk." ;
    ex:severityScore "0.8"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:riskClass ex:SignalMisinterpretationRisk .

ex:Risk3 a ex:SafetyRisk ;
    ex:riskDescription "No entry sign obscured by fog may lead to unauthorized entry and potential head-on collisions." ;
    ex:severityScore "0.75"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:riskClass ex:SignMisinterpretationRisk .
```